# Praevis agent rules

Before changing code: read root `AGENTS.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md`, relevant product docs/tests; optional local `agent/STATUS.md`, `agent/HANDOFF.md`, `docs/TASKS.md` (gitignored).

After meaningful sessions: update local handoff/status/runs (gitignored); commit only product docs when contracts change (`docs/DECISIONS.md`, `docs/API_SPEC.md`).

Do not commit secrets, local session docs, `var/artifacts/`, or `.env`. Do not weaken SSRF/safety checks, execute scanned-page JavaScript, or add LLMs where deterministic rules suffice.

Codename `Praevis` is temporary — keep branding easy to replace.
